   *    The computation is algebraically identical to the original code:
   *      - L(i,j) uses the same update formula but replaces division
   *        by A[j][j] with multiplication by diag_inv[j].
   *      - U(i,*) is computed via a rank-1 update formulation that
   *        preserves the order of operations for each A[i][j].
   * ------------------------------------------------------------------*/
